  "details": {
   "biography": {
    "value": "<p>A weathered ranger in a travel-stained cloak who sits with his back to the wall and his hood up, watching the door. His player built him straight out of a beloved novel at the time and named him Strider, and he has been walking ever since.</p><p><strong>Remnant.</strong> Max Hit Points, never rolled. It never attacks first. It cannot answer any question about its past that is not its Signature. It cannot leave a room by a door the party came through.</p>",
    "public": ""
   },
