    },
    "description": {
     "value": "<p>Strider is never lost. In the Corridors he knows which door leads where, and if asked the GM tells him the truth (he will offer to lead; where he leads is always toward the Hoard). Once per round one of his Longsword or Longbow attacks hits without a roll for [[/damage 1d8+3 slashing]] plus [[/damage 2d6 slashing]].</p>",
     "chat": ""
    },
