     "recovery": [],
     "max": ""
    },
    "description": {
     "value": "<p>Everything about him past the name and the cloak belongs to somebody else's story. Ask about his lineage and he tells it, earnestly, and it is a story the whole table has read in a book. He does not notice.</p>",
